---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Work">
  <h1 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4">Work</h1>
  <h2 class="font-medium mb-2">Current Focus</h2>
  <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 mb-6">
    <li>Leading iOS development for a high-traffic QSR app</li>
    <li>Gradual architecture unification</li>
    <li>Improving CI reliability and developer velocity</li>
    <li>Reducing cross-repo dependency sprawl</li>
  </ul>

  <h2 class="font-medium mb-2">Past Themes</h2>
  <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2">
    <li>Coordinator-pattern UIKit apps</li>
    <li>SwiftUI adoption without rewrites</li>
    <li>Accessibility-conscious animation</li>
    <li>Modularization that scales</li>
  </ul>
</BaseLayout>
